  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Decent Work in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action will help the Government of Bangladesh to fulfil targets under the EU National Action Plan (NAP) on the Labour Sector in Bangladesh (2021-2026) and the ILO- GoB Roadmap. It aims to support the GoB and national constituents in implementation of legal and administrative reforms to uphold labour rights and workplace safety under NAP. It will consist of 3 specific objectives: 1) support labour law implementation and administration; 2) promote sustainable, responsible and competitive enterprises and 3) support child labour elimination. The Action aligns with the GoB&#xbf;s priorities and supports the country&#xbf;s vision to eradicate poverty and prepare for the Least Developed Country (LDC) graduation in 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
